00:00:02,631 --> 00:00:09,489
test sample from one of my videos

2
00:00:09,489 --> 00:00:16,346


3
00:00:16,346 --> 00:00:23,203
hello everyone! sorry for not being able to keep up with weekly uploads lol, i got a new computer!!

4
00:00:23,203 --> 00:00:30,060
i had made some sketches but i can't bring myself to finish them

5
00:00:30,060 --> 00:00:36,917
mostly because they are overly complicated and take way too long to finish

6
00:00:36,917 --> 00:00:43,774
and also cause i get bored listening to the same section 10 times over lmao

7
00:00:43,774 --> 00:00:50,631
so i decided to reuse the strategy that got me the weekly consistency

8
00:00:50,631 --> 00:00:57,489
to make multiple projects side by side and finish whatever i wanted to

9
00:00:57,489 --> 00:01:04,346
i might finish one project, and go back to another one that's halfway finished

10
00:01:04,346 --> 00:01:11,203
and it's new to me again, since it's probably been a few days since i've touched it

11
00:01:11,203 --> 00:01:18,060
it fixes the boredom really well, and i get more motivation to finish it

12
00:01:18,060 --> 00:01:24,917
because it's only half the work. also i can polish things up and not get tunnel visioned

13
00:01:24,917 --> 00:01:31,774
unlike after listening to the same thing over and over and over and over again. i think you get the point lol

14
00:01:31,774 --> 00:01:38,631
i've been wanting to just, relax for a bit. i've been doing a lot lately, lots of goals set out

15
00:01:38,631 --> 00:01:45,489
but sometimes all i really want is a break, and i can't seem to know how to take one

16
00:01:45,489 --> 00:01:52,346
i wanted to make a piece that's more laid back just to relax things a bit for me

17
00:01:52,346 --> 00:01:59,203
i hope you can also sometimes, give yourself a break, you deserve it! even if being productive is good however

18
00:01:59,203 --> 00:02:06,060
we glorify productivity too much nowadays to the point of ignoring yourself, and i don't think that's healthy really. take care of youself aswell, and thanks for listening!

